{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"0d0298ab","metadata":{"id":"0d0298ab"},"source":["# Sprint3 Part1 — 하이퍼파라미터 튜닝\n","**목표:** GridSearchCV / RandomizedSearchCV / Bayesian Optimization으로 최적 하이퍼파라미터 찾기  \n","**내용:**  \n","1) 기본 모델 성능을 기준선(Baseline)으로 잡는다  \n","2) GridSearchCV로 **작은 탐색 공간을 “완전탐색”** 해본다  \n","3) RandomizedSearchCV로 **큰 탐색 공간을 “확률적 탐색”** 한다  \n","4) **Bayesian Optimization 기반 탐색**을 수행하고, Best 모델을 재학습한다  \n","\n","> 이 노트북은 **회귀(Regression)모델** 기준 예시이며, 데이터/피처셋만 바꾸면 그대로 재사용 가능.  \n","> 아래 코드는 `X_tr_EDA, X_va_EDA, X_te_EDA, y_train, y_val` 가  \n","이미 만들어져 있다고 가정하고 있으므로, 데이터셋을 코랩에 업로드 하고 시작한다.  \n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"806dbac8","metadata":{"id":"806dbac8"},"source":["## 0. 환경 준비"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":4,"id":"f7235bb3","metadata":{"id":"f7235bb3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773012652418,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":4740,"user":{"displayName":"Maureen YEO","userId":"04660863903311767268"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["!pip -q install hyperopt"]},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# 준비된 데이터셋 코랩 업로드 후 로드\n","import pandas as pd\n","\n","X_tr_EDA = pd.read_csv('/content/X_tr_EDA.csv')\n","X_va_EDA = pd.read_csv('/content/X_va_EDA.csv')\n","y_train = pd.read_csv('/content/y_train.csv')\n","y_val = pd.read_csv('/content/y_val.csv')"],"metadata":{"id":"SymXw9tPwJ5_","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773012652472,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":36,"user":{"displayName":"Maureen YEO","userId":"04660863903311767268"}}},"id":"SymXw9tPwJ5_","execution_count":5,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"830b17b4","metadata":{"id":"830b17b4"},"source":["## 1. 공통 설정: 평가 지표/교차검증 함수"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":6,"id":"16792c2b","metadata":{"id":"16792c2b","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773012652476,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":2,"user":{"displayName":"Maureen YEO","userId":"04660863903311767268"}}},"outputs":[],"source":["import numpy as np\n","import pandas as pd\n","\n","from sklearn.model_selection import KFold\n","from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error, r2_score, make_scorer\n","\n","import warnings\n","warnings.filterwarnings(\"ignore\")\n","\n","# rmse 계산 함수\n","def rmse(y_true, y_pred):\n","    return np.sqrt(mean_squared_error(y_true, y_pred))\n","\n","rmse_scorer = make_scorer(rmse, greater_is_better=False)\n","\n","# CV 교차 검증\n","cv = KFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=42)\n","\n","def eval_regression(model, X_tr, y_tr, X_va, y_va, name=\"model\"):\n","    model.fit(X_tr, y_tr)\n","    pred_tr = model.predict(X_tr)\n","    pred_va = model.predict(X_va)\n","\n","    out = {\n","        \"model\": name,\n","        \"RMSE_train\": rmse(y_tr, pred_tr),\n","        \"RMSE_val\": rmse(y_va, pred_va),\n","        \"R2_train\": r2_score(y_tr, pred_tr),\n","        \"R2_val\": r2_score(y_va, pred_va),\n","    }\n","    return out"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"61d2bebb","metadata":{"id":"61d2bebb"},"source":["## 2. Baseline 모델 (튜닝 전 기준선)"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":7,"id":"43f49872","metadata":{"id":"43f49872","colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":143},"executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1773012666035,"user_tz":-540,"elapsed":13556,"user":{"displayName":"Maureen YEO","userId":"04660863903311767268"}},"outputId":"38163947-450c-40b2-e6b1-1e8b173a1d38"},"outputs":[{"output_type":"execute_result","data":{"text/plain":["          model  RMSE_train    RMSE_val  R2_train    R2_val\n","2  XGB_baseline   59.601339  164.902664  0.991653  0.933405\n","1   RF_baseline   65.449605  177.472669  0.989935  0.922866\n","0   DT_baseline    0.000000  246.220540  1.000000  0.851532"],"text/html":["\n","  <div id=\"df-8a2069bd-0574-4bd1-88e8-dc8dfd124b1f\" class=\"colab-df-container\">\n","    <div>\n","<style scoped>\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th:only-of-type {\n","        vertical-align: middle;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe tbody tr th {\n","        vertical-align: top;\n","    }\n","\n","    .dataframe thead th {\n","        